          "LastName": "Gershman",
          "Initials": "SJ",
          "AffiliationInfo": {"Affiliation": "Department of Psychology and Center for Brain Science, Harvard University."}
        }
      },
      "ArticleTitle": "Predicting the Past, Remembering the Future.",
